{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>香港天文台於今日上午11時15分發出特別天氣提示，受強烈東北季候風影響，本港氣溫顯著下降。同時，一道廣闊雲帶正為本港帶來持續降雨，預料日間天氣將進一步轉冷。由於風寒效應，體感溫度可能更低。\n</p>\n<p>天文台提醒市民，特別是進行戶外活動的人士，需密切留意天氣變化，並採取適當的保暖措施。建議穿著保暖衣物，避免長時間暴露於寒冷環境中。此外，請特別關心長者及慢性病患者的健康狀況，確保他們得到足夠的保護。</p>\n<p>市民如需外出，請攜帶雨具以應對可能的降雨，並注意路面濕滑情況。天文台將密切監察天氣變化，並適時發出最新消息，請留意相關更新。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%af%92%e5%86%b7%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">寒冷天氣</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 20 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:03:52.258747+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":295,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T03:45:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:37:28.295593+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T03:57:24.207194+00:00","content_hash":"9f4675c5a374c287d68d1f3e6c21d80962c8d86002cb9bb41d19087559e54322","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}